\par\par \b \uc2 AT A GLANCE: Asia Stocks Pounded By US Turmoil; Yen Gains\b0\par\par\uc2 1,431 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 September 2008\par 09:19\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 Markets in Japan, China, Hong Kong and South Korea have had their first chance Tuesday to react to the major realignment on Wall Street and the subsequent fallout in U.S. markets.\par \par \uc2 Financial stocks led the way sharply lower, while the U.S. dollar was benefiting from flight-to-safety interest against emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  like the won, though the yen was the main gainer. U.S. Treasurys were higher, while Japanese government bonds soared. Asian credit default swap spreads widened to record levels.\par \par \uc2 Following is a summary of Dow Jones' coverage of the impact in Asia from the tumult on Wall Street:\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par =3RD UPDATE: ASIAN STOCKS SLUMP, YEN RISES; BANK STOCKS HIT \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Asian stock markets and \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  sustained heavy losses Tuesday as investors continued to watch with alarm developments in the U.S. financial sector and talk grew that the Federal Reserve might move later in the day to cut interest rates. (published 0651 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par TOKYO SHARES SLIDE TO 3-YEAR LOW AS BANKS, INSURERS TUMBLE \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Tokyo stocks sank to a three-year low Tuesday following a Wall Street slide prompted by the collapse of \f28 \uc2 \f2 Lehman Brothers Holdings\f28 \uc2 \f2 , with global financial jitters causing some Japanese financial stocks to drop by double digits. (published 0640 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par =ASIA \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FOREX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 : DOLLAR FALLS TO 2 MO-LOW VS YEN ON RISK AVERSION \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Growing risk-aversion following the turmoil in the U.S. financial sector caused the yen to strengthen further on unwinding of so-called carry trades, causing the dollar to drop to a two month-low against the Japanese \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . (published 0552 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par =ASIA CREDIT DEFAULT SWAPS HIT RECORD HIGHS ON US BANK CRISIS \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The cost of protecting investors against default, and of restructuring Asia's debts, rose to historic highs Tuesday, as players braced for more credit losses following the collapse of \f28 \uc2 \f2 Lehman Brothers\f28 \uc2 \f2  and troubles at other banks. (published 0445 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par JAPAN GOVT BONDS SURGE AFTER LEHMAN BANKRUPTCY, MKT TURMOIL \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Japanese government bonds surged Tuesday as players rushed to buy safe-haven government debt and dumped stocks amid financial market turmoil after \f28 \uc2 \f2 Lehman Brothers\f28 \uc2 \f2  declared bankruptcy. (published 0707 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par =UPDATE: BOJ INJECTS FUNDS AS WALL ST FALLOUT HITS TOKYO \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank of Japan\f28 \uc2 \f2  injected Y2.5 trillion into Japanese money markets Tuesday and said it would work to ensure stability in the market, as the aftershocks of Monday's upheaval on Wall Street rocked Tokyo markets reopening after a holiday weekend. (published 0549 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par =COMMODITY PRICES HIT BY FINCL MKT TURMOIL AS FUNDS MOVE OUT \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Despite the likelihood of a turnaround in the demand outlook following a surprise interest rate cut in China and the falling price of fuel which should help other commodities, the ongoing financial market turmoil will continue to weigh on commodity prices in general, analysts said Tuesday. (published 0529 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par WSJ(9/16) UPDATE: LEHMAN IN TALKS TO SELL ASSETS TO BARCLAYS \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Lehman Brothers Holdings Inc\f28 \uc2 \f2 . Monday night was negotiating a last-minute plan to sell large portions of itself to \f28 \uc2 \f2 Barclays PLC\f28 \uc2 \f2 , the U.K. bank that has been circling the U.S. investment house. \f28 \uc2 \f2 Barclays\f28 \uc2 \f2  Americas Chairman Archibald Cox Jr. was leading the talks, and an agreement is hoped to be reached by Tuesday, said a person involved in the talks. (published 0339 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par AIG SURVIVAL PROSPECTS DIM ON CREDIT DOWNGRADE \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Three major credit agencies lowered their ratings Monday for \f28 \uc2 \f2 American International Group Inc\f28 \uc2 \f2 . (AIG), damaging hopes to save one of the one world's biggest insurance companies amid a burgeoning financial crisis. (published 0244 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par JAPAN FINCL COS EXTENDED US$1.67B LOANS TO LEHMAN -NIKKEI \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Japanese financial institutions have extended $1.67 billion, or Y170 billion, worth of loans to \f28 \uc2 \f2 Lehman Brothers Holdings Inc\f28 \uc2 \f2 . (LEH), which has filed for bankruptcy protection, the Nikkei reported Tuesday. (published 0306 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par AOZORA BANK: LEHMAN NET EXPOSURE MUCH LESS THAN REPORTED \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Aozora Bank Ltd\f28 \uc2 \f2 . said Tuesday its net exposure to \f28 \uc2 \f2 Lehman Brothers Holdings\f28 \uc2 \f2  is much less than the $463 million reported in the U.S. investment bank's bankruptcy filing. (published 0002 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par JAPAN GOVT, BOJ GOV MEET ON LEHMAN, TO WATCH MKTS - KYODO \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Japan's finance-related government ministers and \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank of Japan\f28 \uc2 \f2  Gov. Masaaki Shirakawa held an emergency meeting Tuesday to discuss the financial market turmoil following \f28 \uc2 \f2 Lehman Brothers Holdings Inc\f28 \uc2 \f2 .'s bankruptcy filing, Kyodo reported. (published 0237 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par =UPDATE:\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 JAPAN\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 'S IBUKI HINTS NO IMMINENT \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 INTERVENTION\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  VS YEN \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's finance minister on Tuesday brushed aside the yen's jump over the past couple of days as "within expectations," suggesting Tokyo feels little urge to hold down its \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  through market \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . (published 0541 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par HKMA: EXPECT VOLATILITY IN HK MKTS;DON'T SEE SYSTEMIC PROBLEM \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Hong Kong \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Chief Executive Joseph Yam said Tuesday he expects the city's financial markets to be negatively affected by the developments in the U.S., and added the city's de facto \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  stands ready to provide liquidity to local banks if needed. (published 0002 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par =3RD UPDATE:S KOREA SEEKS TO PROTECT MKTS FROM LEHMAN FALLOUT \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 South Korean authorities acted Tuesday to protect local investors from the impact of \f28 \uc2 \f2 Lehman Brothers Holdings Inc\f28 \uc2 \f2 .'s bankruptcy filing and to calm local stock and \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets, which plunged on Monday's news. (published 0706 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par JAPAN YOSANO: US FINCL WOES LIKELY TO AFFECT JAPAN ECONOMY \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Japanese Economy Minister Kaoru Yosano said Tuesday that the country's economy cannot escape downward pressures from the U.S. financial turmoil. (published 0257 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par JAPAN BANK MIN: NO BIG LEHMAN EFFECT ON FINCL SECTOR FOR NOW \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Japanese bank minister Toshimitsu Motegi said Tuesday that he doesn't expect the failure of \f28 \uc2 \f2 Lehman Brothers Holdings Inc\f28 \uc2 \f2 . to have a heavy impact on domestic financial institutions for now. (published 0311 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par =2ND UPDATE: LEHMAN SUSPENDS HK OPS BUT KEEPS FUNDS ARM GOING \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Lehman Brothers Holdings Inc\f28 \uc2 \f2 . suspended trading, investment banking and brokerage \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in Hong Kong - throwing its clients into disarray as markets fell sharply. (published 0506 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par =UPDATE:TAIWAN GOVT:LARGE STK SALES ON MARGIN CALLS UNLIKELY \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Taiwan's financial regulator said Tuesday massive sales of local shares for margin calls are unlikely, despite the turmoil in the U.S. and Asian markets. (published 0351 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par SINGAPORE MAS:AIG UNIT CURRENTLY MEETING CAPITAL REQUIREMENTS \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of Singapore said Tuesday that \f28 \uc2 \f2 American International Group Inc\f28 \uc2 \f2 .'s life insurance unit, AIA, currently has sufficient financial resources to meet policy claims. (published 0341 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par AIG HONG KONG UNIT: LOCAL \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 OPERATIONS\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  REMAIN NORMAL \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The Hong Kong life insurance arm of \f28 \uc2 \f2 American International Group Inc\f28 \uc2 \f2 . said Tuesday its \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the city remain normal. (published 0657 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par BANK OF CHINA:CLOSELY WATCHING LEHMAN UNSECURED DEBT HOLDINGS \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Bank of China Ltd\f28 \uc2 \f2 . spokesman Wang Zhaowen said Tuesday the lender is closely watching its holdings of unsecured credit issued by \f28 \uc2 \f2 Lehman Brothers Holdings Inc\f28 \uc2 \f2 . (published 0428 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par MIZUHO TRUST CUTS 1H GROUP NET PFT VIEW DUE TO LEHMAN LOANS \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Mizuho Trust & Banking Co\f28 \uc2 \f2 . said Tuesday it cut its group net profit outlook to Y9 billion for the fiscal year ending March from the previous forecast of Y21 billion due to uncollectable loans to \f28 \uc2 \f2 Lehman Brothers Holdings Inc\f28 \uc2 \f2 ., which filed for U.S. bankruptcy-court protection Monday. (published 0450 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par MIZUHO INVESTORS: HOLD Y3.3B WORTH OF LEHMAN'S BONDS \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Mizuho Investors Securities Co\f28 \uc2 \f2 . said Tuesday it holds Y3.3 billion worth of corporate bonds issued by \f28 \uc2 \f2 Lehman Brothers Holdings Inc\f28 \uc2 \f2 . (published 0613 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par SUMITOMO MITSUI FG: EXPECT Y10B LOSS FROM LEHMAN LOANS \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Sumitomo Mitsui Financial Group Inc\f28 \uc2 \f2 . said Tuesday it expects Y10 billion in losses from credits to \f28 \uc2 \f2 Lehman Brothers Holdings Inc\f28 \uc2 \f2 . and will make the appropriate accounting adjustments this fiscal year ending March. (published 0605 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par SUMITOMO TRUST:LEHMAN EXPOSURE IN DERIVATIVES TRADE ABOUT Y6B \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Sumitomo Trust & Banking Co\f28 \uc2 \f2 . said Tuesday it has a net exposure of about Y6 billion in derivatives trading to \f28 \uc2 \f2 Lehman Brothers Holdings Inc\f28 \uc2 \f2 ., which filed for U.S. bankruptcy-court protection Monday. (published 0343 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par HUA AN FUND: LEHMAN BANKRUPTCY MAY CAUSE LOSS ON QDII FUND \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Hua An Fund Management Co., China's eighth-largest asset manager, said Monday \f28 \uc2 \f2 Lehman Brothers Holdings Inc\f28 \uc2 \f2 .'s bankruptcy may lead to losses on its sole overseas fund and place the survival of the fund in doubt. (published 0456 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par =UPDATE: BANCO DE ORO SETS ASIDE PHP3.8B FOR LEHMAN EXPOSURE \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Banco De Oro Unibank Inc. Tuesday said it has exposure to \f28 \uc2 \f2 Lehman Brothers Holdings Inc\f28 \uc2 \f2 ., and is setting aside provisions of PHP3.8 billion to cover losses that may arise from that investment. (published 0227 GMT) [ 16-09-08 0719GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020080916e49g000cq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
